  pageNumber: 5
  noteTitle: Research Fragments 1/4
  noteContent: "instability within the matrix is progressing faster than I calculated.
    The 'Entity' is manifesting, though still chaotically. I require a more stable...
    conduit? Medium? I dread the worst-case scenario. Emergency unlocking of the
    main doors requires the Dean's Access Card \u2013 it is the only thing capable
    of overriding the lockdown protocol. The key to his office... I was analyzing
    the latest data in Computer Lab 1 on our floor, and I fear I left it there...
    I must retrieve it."
